/Title (Following his undergraduate studies, Armian joined the prestigious California Institute of Technology \(Caltech\) and the Jet Propulsion Laboratory \(JPL\). There, he honed his skills and expertise in digital parts reliability engineering, playing a crucial role in ensuring the success of NASA's space missions.)
